OUTPUT LOCATIONS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Frames saved to:
  macOS:   ~/Library/Caches/bsdOS/
  Linux:   /tmp/bsdos-viewer/

Files:
  latest.ppm              Raw PPM (always saved)
  frame-XXXXXX-*.png      Timestamped PNG (QuickLook preview)

